WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.346
Success: a short note that closes by itself.

00:00:02.346 --> 00:00:04.380
Warning: stays until it is closed.

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:07.188
Error: read out at once by screen readers.

00:00:07.188 --> 00:00:09.280
Each one has an icon and a word, never colour alone.
